1
00:02:11,616 --> 00:02:13,616


2
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:26,480
Whoa, what's that?

3
00:03:53,590 --> 00:03:54,260
There they are!

4
00:03:54,442 --> 00:03:57,740
As the fox proverb goes, where there are humans, there is food.

5
00:03:57,765 --> 00:04:00,377
It's a bit risky, but let me help myself.

6
00:04:06,690 --> 00:04:10,020
Has no one mentioned Zuru's name during this year's fox hunt?

7
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:10,700
Zuru?

8
00:04:10,804 --> 00:04:12,900
Oh, you mean that crafty vixen?

9
00:04:13,124 --> 00:04:15,200
She always gives us trouble.

10
00:04:16,290 --> 00:04:18,082
She's a monster fox who speaks human words

11
00:04:18,106 --> 00:04:21,180
and possesses wisdom beyond any human.

12
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:23,220
She truly is quite something.

13
00:04:23,371 --> 00:04:28,500
Since she understands our speech, she sees through everything humans do and outsmarts us.

14
00:04:28,665 --> 00:04:30,080
She's completely impossible to handle.

15
00:04:31,275 --> 00:04:34,740
This time, I'd love to hang her pelt in my room.

16
00:04:34,934 --> 00:04:37,722
Ah, that golden fur is valuable, too.

17
00:04:37,746 --> 00:04:39,719
Catching her would make it a national treasure.

18
00:04:39,865 --> 00:04:42,420
Where could that Zuru be hiding?

19
00:04:44,612 --> 00:04:46,980
What's this useless mutt dawdling for?

20
00:04:47,185 --> 00:04:48,185
Hurry into the forest!

21
00:04:51,857 --> 00:04:54,248
Looks like they were bitten by a beast.

22
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:56,080
Hmm, then it can't be helped.

23
00:05:13,330 --> 00:05:14,460
Who on earth did this?

24
00:05:15,770 --> 00:05:17,440
My precious booze is ruined!

25
00:05:21,090 --> 00:05:22,640
There's sand in here instead of wine.

26
00:05:24,315 --> 00:05:25,880
There's a frog in this pot!

27
00:05:26,395 --> 00:05:28,220
Looks like the meat is fine...

28
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:30,360
...Wait, she got to this one, too.

29
00:05:38,530 --> 00:05:40,040
Zuru showed up? Where is she?

30
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:43,179
She's not the type to show her tail.

31
00:05:44,110 --> 00:05:47,320
But no one except Zuru could pull off a heist this slick.

32
00:05:48,195 --> 00:05:51,120
Hey, there are footprints over here!

33
00:05:53,245 --> 00:05:54,920
Yeah, no doubt about it. It's Zuru.

34
00:05:55,180 --> 00:05:56,420
Looks like she fled into the forest.

35
00:05:57,660 --> 00:05:59,440
Humans are so foolish.

36
00:05:59,845 --> 00:06:02,300
I'm still starving!

37
00:06:02,970 --> 00:06:05,100
Did you think I'd give up that easily?

38
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:08,540
I made those footprints walking backward!

39
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:12,086
Prince Sapphire.

40
00:06:12,450 --> 00:06:13,450
I'm over here!

41
00:06:14,375 --> 00:06:15,940
A letter has arrived at the castle.

42
00:06:16,245 --> 00:06:17,974
It's from Prince Franz.

43
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:19,880
From Prince Franz?

44
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:25,280
How are you, Prince Sapphire?

45
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:32,180
Have you found the flaxen-haired girl I danced with yet?

46
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,619
Flaxen-haired...

47
00:06:47,250 --> 00:06:48,857
Welcome, Prince Franz.

48
00:06:51,050 --> 00:06:51,957
Franz...

49
00:07:00,870 --> 00:07:01,893
He couldn't tell...

50
00:07:01,917 --> 00:07:05,260
Why can't he figure out that I'm the flaxen-haired girl?

51
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,600
It's Zuru!

52
00:07:15,290 --> 00:07:17,706
Nice to meet you, Princess.

53
00:07:17,731 --> 00:07:18,317
What?

54
00:07:18,510 --> 00:07:19,510
I'm a prince!

55
00:07:19,740 --> 00:07:23,100
What a strange prince. Aren't you actually a princess?

56
00:07:23,340 --> 00:07:24,340
Stop it!

57
00:07:39,267 --> 00:07:41,267
Wait Zuru!

58
00:07:59,050 --> 00:07:59,639
Whoa!

59
00:07:59,663 --> 00:08:00,290
Opal!

60
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:08,520
Get down here!

61
00:08:23,420 --> 00:08:26,420
To think a human would fall for a trap made by humans.

62
00:08:26,685 --> 00:08:28,391
Goodbye, Princess!

63
00:08:28,690 --> 00:08:29,440
Ah, wait!

64
00:08:29,575 --> 00:08:30,580
That's sneaky, Zuru! Sneaky!

65
00:08:36,729 --> 00:08:38,100
I smell iron.

66
00:08:38,575 --> 00:08:40,419
Watch out! Look out!

67
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:48,920
A human scent?

68
00:08:54,089 --> 00:08:55,326
Is something wrong with your nose?

69
00:08:59,339 --> 00:09:02,300
Do you really think you can catch me with that?

70
00:09:09,650 --> 00:09:10,780
You got me!

71
00:09:11,130 --> 00:09:12,984
I did it! I did it!

72
00:09:13,955 --> 00:09:15,261
Plastic!

73
00:09:16,319 --> 00:09:19,035
Ah, Papa, Papa! Look at this cannon!

74
00:09:19,060 --> 00:09:19,635
Hey!

75
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:20,871
Watch out, watch out!

76
00:09:23,739 --> 00:09:27,302
Plastic, you've grown up so splendidly!

77
00:09:30,749 --> 00:09:32,175
So kingly!

78
00:09:33,250 --> 00:09:37,380
Oh, I can't wait to see you become the true king!

79
00:09:37,381 --> 00:09:38,340
I wanna be the king!

80
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,980
I know, I know!

81
00:09:40,340 --> 00:09:43,280
To do that, we must deal with Sapphire!

82
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:46,108
Popa, I wanna be the king!

83
00:09:46,329 --> 00:09:48,400
I told you, I know!

84
00:09:48,460 --> 00:09:49,940
That's why Papa has to work so hard!

85
00:09:50,226 --> 00:09:53,404
Ah, I wanna be the king!

86
00:09:53,925 --> 00:09:58,080
Stop throwing a tantrum and shoot the bow like a noble future king!

87
00:09:59,009 --> 00:10:00,009
Shoot what?

88
00:10:00,649 --> 00:10:01,420
Isn't it obvious?

89
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,620
That rascal, Zuru!

90
00:10:06,509 --> 00:10:08,019
Poor thing...

91
00:10:08,245 --> 00:10:10,880
Don't fall for that trick!

92
00:10:11,014 --> 00:10:14,080
If you kill her, you'll win today's top honors!

93
00:10:14,380 --> 00:10:16,780
We can put Sapphire to shame!

94
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,782
Hurry up!

95
00:10:25,228 --> 00:10:27,013
You fool, what are you doing?!

96
00:10:27,194 --> 00:10:30,575
But Papa, you told me to hit it with the bow!

97
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,680
Do it over!

98
00:10:31,750 --> 00:10:32,880
Shoot it with an arrow!

99
00:10:34,809 --> 00:10:36,800
Grand Duke, so this is where you were.

100
00:10:36,955 --> 00:10:40,022
Ah, Lord Nylon. How was the castle inspection?

101
00:10:40,907 --> 00:10:41,261
Well,

102
00:10:41,285 --> 00:10:44,101
taking advantage of Sapphire's absence, I searched his room and found...

103
00:10:45,143 --> 00:10:46,540
this box.

104
00:10:47,139 --> 00:10:49,296
It looks like a woman's item...

105
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:52,740
If there's proof inside that he's a woman, we've hit the jackpot!

106
00:10:53,429 --> 00:10:54,880
Only a man can be king!

107
00:10:55,100 --> 00:10:58,700
We'll send Sapphire to the scaffold for posing as a prince!

108
00:10:59,496 --> 00:11:04,164
And then your son, Lord Plastic, as the King's relative, will become the next king...

109
00:11:04,188 --> 00:11:05,906
Go on, open it!

110
00:11:13,769 --> 00:11:17,333
Thanks for your trouble, you blind fools of the castle!

111
00:11:17,357 --> 00:11:18,001
Damn it!

112
00:11:18,099 --> 00:11:19,280
He's making fools of us!

113
00:11:21,689 --> 00:11:22,840
What's so funny?

114
00:11:23,205 --> 00:11:24,760
You said 'blind fools,' didn't you?

115
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:28,320
Do you want proof that the prince is a girl?

116
00:11:28,375 --> 00:11:30,131
W-What did you say?

117
00:11:30,510 --> 00:11:31,560
I happen to know.

118
00:11:31,584 --> 00:11:34,980
I'll tell you everything if you help me.

119
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,260
Oh no!

120
00:11:46,450 --> 00:11:48,142
We have to find Sapphire fast!

121
00:11:49,133 --> 00:11:49,574
Quickly!

122
00:11:49,635 --> 00:11:50,107
Quickly!

123
00:11:50,245 --> 00:11:51,245
Hurry!

124
00:11:51,300 --> 00:11:52,300
Hurry!

125
00:11:53,050 --> 00:11:54,620
Sapphire!

126
00:11:55,889 --> 00:11:57,680
Sapphire!

127
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:00,480
Oh, Usagi-kun!

128
00:12:00,900 --> 00:12:04,022
Have you seen a girl... I mean, boy named Sapphire?

129
00:12:05,279 --> 00:12:08,508
That boy is sleeping in a pitfall right over there?

130
00:12:09,220 --> 00:12:10,346
Thank you!

131
00:12:12,419 --> 00:12:13,419
Sapphire!

132
00:12:13,630 --> 00:12:14,844
Sapphire!

133
00:12:14,869 --> 00:12:15,869
Oh, Tink!

134
00:12:16,260 --> 00:12:17,260
This is bad!

135
00:12:17,325 --> 00:12:21,580
Zuru's going to tell Grand Duke Duralumin that you're a girl!

136
00:12:21,940 --> 00:12:22,940
To Duralumin?

137
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:25,300
Hey, hurry and grab onto this!

138
00:12:30,789 --> 00:12:32,264
Thanks, Tink!

139
00:12:33,699 --> 00:12:35,640
Hey, where's Zuru?

140
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:38,160
Oh, right!

141
00:12:38,955 --> 00:12:40,110
Um, um, um...

142
00:12:41,038 --> 00:12:43,960
I forgot which way she went...

143
00:12:44,060 --> 00:12:48,024
Geez, forgetting something so important! You really are dumb, Tink!

144
00:12:48,170 --> 00:12:50,500
Mind your own business! I don't need you calling me dumb!

145
00:12:50,565 --> 00:12:52,900
Hunting isn't something a girl should be doing anyway!

146
00:12:53,734 --> 00:12:55,040
You're just a kid, keep quiet!

147
00:12:55,110 --> 00:12:56,980
You keep calling me a kid!

148
00:12:57,380 --> 00:12:58,980
Aren't you just a kid yourself?

149
00:12:59,255 --> 00:13:02,980
Besides, coming to ruin the Peaceful Forest with a hunt is wrong!

150
00:13:05,079 --> 00:13:06,360
A-Alright, Tink!

151
00:13:06,870 --> 00:13:08,540
I'll search for him by myself!

152
00:13:11,394 --> 00:13:12,461
Bleehhhh!

153
00:13:13,262 --> 00:13:15,923
But Sapphire's secret will be exposed...

154
00:13:22,822 --> 00:13:24,840
Ah, we can't let that happen!

155
00:13:25,565 --> 00:13:26,280
Hey!

156
00:13:26,420 --> 00:13:27,740
Mogura-kun!

157
00:13:32,209 --> 00:13:33,326
I've found a lead, but...

158
00:13:41,569 --> 00:13:44,700
Papa, can I kill this fox?

159
00:13:45,230 --> 00:13:46,633
Hey, Papa, this fox... Don't kill it!

160
00:13:46,658 --> 00:13:48,772
Shhh! That's enough of that!

161
00:13:49,340 --> 00:13:50,240
No fair!

162
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:53,468
I'm the one who wants to get the credit!

163
00:13:54,929 --> 00:13:56,240
Be good and wait!

164
00:13:56,475 --> 00:14:00,720
Once I have proof the Prince is a girl, I'll let you strike that fox down immediately!

165
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,120
Really?!

166
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:04,720
Enough already!

167
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,646
You promised you'd talk once your stomach was full!

168
00:14:06,889 --> 00:14:09,646
My, humans are so impatient.

169
00:14:10,359 --> 00:14:13,360
Well, I'll take the rest home as a treat.

170
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:14,900
Alright, now talk!

171
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:18,960
No. First, we must perform a Fox Tribe ritual.

172
00:14:19,660 --> 00:14:20,200
A ritual?

173
00:14:20,540 --> 00:14:21,540
What's that supposed to be?

174
00:14:22,150 --> 00:14:25,360
It's a ritual to swear that my story is true.

175
00:14:25,495 --> 00:14:26,600
If you don't mind.

176
00:14:28,915 --> 00:14:32,353
A few sulfur rock fragments and a pile of juniper leaves.

177
00:14:32,689 --> 00:14:34,280
You're going to do a ritual with <i>that</i>?

178
00:14:34,281 --> 00:14:35,435
Nylon!

179
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:38,220
Never mind that, hurry up and gather them!

180
00:14:38,271 --> 00:14:40,751
Can I beat him up when we're finished?

181
00:14:50,689 --> 00:14:54,160
Now, Lord Nylon, please light the fire.

182
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:55,220
Light it?

183
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:59,640
It's to offer a prayer to our Ancestral Fairy. Go ahead and light it.

184
00:15:15,819 --> 00:15:17,320
Whoa! Look at all this smoke!

185
00:15:18,169 --> 00:15:20,059
Look, Zuru's gone!

186
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:23,520
Search!

187
00:15:23,611 --> 00:15:24,251
Search!

188
00:15:52,259 --> 00:15:53,900
Oh, I got it, Mogura-kun.

189
00:15:54,949 --> 00:15:57,508
Alright, I've got it, I've got it!

190
00:15:58,903 --> 00:15:59,834
It's Tink!

191
00:16:00,429 --> 00:16:01,520
Tink!

192
00:16:03,359 --> 00:16:04,891
Hey, did you find Zuru?

193
00:16:06,559 --> 00:16:08,380
Mogura-kun told me.

194
00:16:08,745 --> 00:16:10,220
He said she's near the swamp.

195
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:12,280
There she is!

196
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:14,760
Zuru!

197
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:16,422
You won't get away this time!

198
00:16:16,980 --> 00:16:20,951
Please forgive me, sir! I can't die in a place like this!

199
00:16:21,210 --> 00:16:23,340
My sweet children are waiting for me!

200
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:24,700
Trying to play the pity card, Zuru?

201
00:16:25,150 --> 00:16:27,080
I won't be fooled by a fox ever again!

202
00:16:27,995 --> 00:16:30,820
I don't want to die, I don't want to die, I don't want to die!

203
00:16:31,070 --> 00:16:33,500
My three babies will die too!

204
00:16:36,609 --> 00:16:38,620
My little ones, your mother is going to be killed...

205
00:16:38,779 --> 00:16:41,000
...by these heartless humans.

206
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:43,480
Is that true?

207
00:16:43,620 --> 00:16:45,120
Is there really a child like that?

208
00:16:46,209 --> 00:16:46,880
It's true.

209
00:16:47,194 --> 00:16:49,700
A cute little thing like you?

210
00:16:51,819 --> 00:16:52,819
What are you doing, you cheat?!

211
00:16:53,409 --> 00:16:57,986
As you can see, if you don't want your friend to get bitten, disarm the trap...

212
00:17:00,229 --> 00:17:02,760
Take it off, Princess.

213
00:17:09,259 --> 00:17:12,475
I'll hold onto this child for later.

214
00:17:13,649 --> 00:17:15,980
Ugh, that golden fox! Now I'm really mad!

215
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:17,640
Go!

216
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:42,906
Zuru, wait!

217
00:18:09,601 --> 00:18:10,220
Oh, Zuru.

218
00:18:10,324 --> 00:18:12,351
Just surrender quietly.

219
00:18:13,142 --> 00:18:13,491
Ouch!

220
00:18:14,549 --> 00:18:17,320
Shoot if you dare. This kid will die with me.

221
00:18:17,460 --> 00:18:18,460
Fine by me.

222
00:18:20,299 --> 00:18:23,708
A dead kid or two won't bother us at all.

223
00:18:25,369 --> 00:18:28,000
Humans are so much worse than foxes.

224
00:18:33,140 --> 00:18:36,004
Alright. Just capture me already.

225
00:18:38,129 --> 00:18:41,180
Don't listen to Nylon's orders!

226
00:18:43,060 --> 00:18:43,780
Ouch!

227
00:18:46,289 --> 00:18:47,780
There's no escaping now.

228
00:18:48,495 --> 00:18:49,879
I'm no fool, you know.

229
00:18:50,059 --> 00:18:51,780
I only run when I can get away.

230
00:18:54,416 --> 00:18:55,620
Whoa, a bear!

231
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:06,231
My babies!

232
00:19:28,745 --> 00:19:29,820
My babies!

233
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:32,940
After her! After her!

234
00:19:48,059 --> 00:19:49,339
Watch out! Both of you!

235
00:19:49,820 --> 00:19:51,640
Zuru's going to be killed!

236
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:58,040
Can't win with brains, so you're resorting to brute force, huh?

237
00:20:06,919 --> 00:20:09,160
So the story about the three babies wasn't a lie!

238
00:20:11,946 --> 00:20:13,426
Zuru, I'll save you!

239
00:20:15,969 --> 00:20:18,320
Was Sapphire after Zuru too?

240
00:20:19,439 --> 00:20:21,540
Alright, big guy, you're fighting me!

241
00:20:22,269 --> 00:20:24,240
Zuru, stay there and protect the babies.

242
00:20:50,999 --> 00:20:52,660
I have to hurry and help Sapphire!

243
00:21:03,509 --> 00:21:04,800
Look, look, look!

244
00:21:16,379 --> 00:21:18,920
Did you come to help me too, Mr. Mole?

245
00:21:25,780 --> 00:21:27,453
Hooray!

246
00:21:28,809 --> 00:21:29,809
Hooray!

247
00:21:29,895 --> 00:21:31,020
Hooray!

248
00:21:31,044 --> 00:21:33,102
You saved me, Master Sapphire!

249
00:21:34,214 --> 00:21:35,340
Well, bravo!

250
00:21:37,294 --> 00:21:38,460
Are you okay, Sapphire?

251
00:21:39,844 --> 00:21:41,320
It's okay, Tink.

252
00:21:41,969 --> 00:21:43,968
Still, I wonder if Kuma-san is okay.

253
00:21:44,420 --> 00:21:45,420
I'll go check!

254
00:21:45,559 --> 00:21:46,860
You sure are busy, Tink.

255
00:21:51,439 --> 00:21:52,782
Are you okay, Kuma-san?

256
00:21:53,369 --> 00:21:55,320
That was a fine display of fighting.

257
00:21:55,659 --> 00:21:58,860
But that fox is my son Plastic's prey!

258
00:21:59,234 --> 00:22:01,420
Hand her over at once.

259
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:02,760
What?

260
00:22:05,859 --> 00:22:07,480
You'll never get your hands on Zuru!

261
00:22:07,994 --> 00:22:09,460
Especially not someone like you!

262
00:22:11,549 --> 00:22:14,720
Regardless of what you say, Zuru will come to us.

263
00:22:14,964 --> 00:22:19,160
It's better than having her beloved children killed alongside her.

264
00:22:19,280 --> 00:22:20,340
Right, Zuru?

265
00:22:23,389 --> 00:22:24,640
Zuru, don't go!

266
00:22:24,920 --> 00:22:25,920
You can't!

267
00:22:37,049 --> 00:22:39,122
Master Sapphire is actually...

268
00:22:39,146 --> 00:22:39,969
Actually?

269
00:22:40,369 --> 00:22:41,369
...a boy.

270
00:22:41,394 --> 00:22:42,168
What?

271
00:22:42,789 --> 00:22:43,800
Don't lie to me!

272
00:22:43,939 --> 00:22:45,489
For you, this is your...

273
00:22:45,514 --> 00:22:46,324
..WEAK SPOT

274
00:22:46,348 --> 00:22:47,860
You betrayed me!

275
00:22:47,900 --> 00:22:48,400
I don't care!

276
00:22:48,409 --> 00:22:50,300
Kill both parent and children!

277
